      <chord name="C"/>Dismiss us, <chord name="F"/>Lord, <chord name="C"/>with <chord name="G"/>blessing, <chord name="C"/>we <chord name="G7"/>pray;<br/>
      <chord name="G7"/>As from Thy worship <chord name="C"/>we go <chord name="B7"/>our <chord name="C"/>ways;<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Guide in life’s con<chord name="C7"/>flicts, <chord name="F"/>all through <chord name="G7"/>the <chord name="F"/>day;<br/>
